            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "DIRECTOR"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "I suppose it's time for the next phase of"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "the Schedule... this is where things might"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "get dicey..."},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "AGENCY CAPTAIN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Corporal Dalia will handle the next phase."
            },
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 15], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "DIRECTOR"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Dalia? Isn't she a bit... abrasive? I don't know"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "whether Eisen will choose to cooperate with"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "her."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "AGENCY CAPTAIN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "He won't have a choice, Sir. The Advocate"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "must be reactivated. Dalia will be acceptable."
            },
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 12], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "DIRECTOR"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Well, there's no denying that she's loyal."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "But Corporal Dalia sometimes lacks..."
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "a gentle touch, shall we say?"
            },
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "DIRECTOR"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Have you found the Slicer yet? We can't"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "let someone just get away with hacking our"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "systems..."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "AGENCY CAPTAIN"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Not yet, Sir. But he will be found."
            },
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [10], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11330, "indent": 0, "parameters": [2, 8, 0, 0, 13], "string": ""},
            {"code": 11410, "indent": 0, "parameters": [5], "string": ""},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "DIRECTOR"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "Good - I want you to offer him a position"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "with the Agency. We can't let his talents"
            },
            {"code": 20110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "remain unattached..."},
            {"code": 10110, "indent": 0, "parameters": [], "string": "DIRECTOR"},
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "...otherwise someone might use them"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
              "string": "against us. Plus, if Eisen refuses to reactivate"
            },
            {
              "code": 20110,
              "indent": 0,
              "parameters": [],
